{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44896","headline":"冬晚姚谏议宅会送元绪上人归南山 · 无可","name":"冬晚姚谏议宅会送元绪上人归南山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禅客诗家见，凝寒忽告还。\n分题回谏笔，留偈在商关。\n盘径缘高雪，闲房在半山。\n自知麋鹿性，亦欲离人间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无可","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44896.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44896","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}